,p_prompt=>'Style'
,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_default_value=>'beamToast'
,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Visual design of the alert, each followed by its Next Collection direction. Beam Toast, motion: floating toast with a light beam travelling around its border. Pulse Critical, motion: banner whose icon and outline breathe with a glow ring, meant for danger. Ticker Bar, motion: one-line announcement bar whose text scrolls as a marquee, stopping on hover and focus. Stacked Toasts, depth: report rows become a 3D stack of toasts that fans out on hover or focus; a single alert shows two cards behind it. Lift Glass, depth: floating frosted glass alert with a light edge and depth shadow. Neo Brutal, bold: ink border, hard offset shadow and a state sticker. Clay, bold: soft pillowy claymorphism surface. Hazard Stripe, bold: warning tape with moving diagonal stripes. Expand Details, smart: compact one-line alert that expands to show message and link. Adaptive Bar, smart: an inline bar when wide, a card when medium and an icon chip when narrow.'
);
